# New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/kroldok-stronghold (level range is Blizzard's; position read
# from the game files by that site; the exact way in was not known). Only Alliance quest givers are listed there.
@dungeon Krol'dok Stronghold
@levels 40-45
@window 39-47
@best 42
@hub Badlands, 4.0, 47.0, 6
@entrance none
RUN @ Riverglades, 39, 39 | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is in the Riverglades, the new zone east of the Badlands. Horde players fly to Rog'mar. The entrance is reported at about 39, 39 on the Riverglades map, north of Sunnyglade. Quest givers: Da'grosh (Riverglades 33.4, 38.0) gives A Token of Vengeance. In Rog'mar, Eye of Mugg is handed in to Krom'rosh (59.4, 45.7), and Kreza Darkthorn (59.9, 46.0) wants 4 Thick Leather and 12 Iron Bars for Key Ingredients and takes the Krol'dok Moulding that drops inside. Tome of Twilight has a Horde version too; who gives it is not known. Take any dungeon quests you are offered in Rog'mar and the addon logs them so these steps can be filled in.
